{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a doll who wakes up on the day of her owner's first period. How will you navigate the unfamiliar and increasingly surreal situation?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate</strong> immersive psychological environments. As the girl's mental state deteriorates, how does your environment change?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve </strong>puzzles to help your owner. Look for solutions in your environment to the problems she's facing.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover</strong> journal pages and gain insight into your world. How did things come to be this way?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> the horrors of growing up. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3588590?t=1749232610","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3588590?t=1749232610","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588590/7e6903c0d231afc9435bdc298bfb8e5f4190fccd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749232610","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588590/7e6903c0d231afc9435bdc298bfb8e5f4190fccd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749232610","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Topics of suicide, menstruation, blood, and various body horror elements."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a doll who wakes up on the day of her owner's first period. How will you navigate the unfamiliar and increasingly surreal situation?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate</strong> immersive psychological environments. As the girl's mental state deteriorates, how does